=2 Walkthrough
* Defeat 3 {m:Maroliths|Marolith} in {z:Cirdas Caverns}.
* You do not need to be in EXP range as long as you are in {z:Cirdas Caverns} when your party/alliance defeats the monsters.
* Confirmed spawn points for Maroliths are F-5 (West of Skirmish Waypoint, no Reives), K-5 (East of Skirmish Waypoint, no Reives), K-11, and F/G-11 (2 spawns at each location).
* 5 minute respawn timer
* Maroliths will only aggro Magic, so you can have someone at the pop without worrying about aggro.
* To optimize time, bank imprimaturs in other coalition assignments (canceling will return them to you) until you can do 13-14 runs in a row (40+ imprimaturs) to complete Partner and Advisor rank while only needing to use the Cirdas Skirmish Waypoint while having two friends do the Maroliths.

